{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wherever intelligent life exists, conflicts, violence, and wars persist without end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet there are always those who care solely about one thing-discovering &quot;delicious food&quot; and sharing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These individuals are nicknamed &quot;Space Foodie&quot; across the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear Foodie, are you ready to begin your gourmet journey in the universe? Fire up your restaurant spaceship and set off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994860/extras/786737dcd39809f9ede4e6a08acd39c7.avif?t=1755482691\" width=1000 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run your restaurant spaceship</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From small to large spaceship, hundreds of decorations can be used to create your restaurant spaceship, both indoor and outdoor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking, serving, cleaning, you may be in a hurry. But don't worry, after you go through the start-up stage, more and more companions will join your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994860/extras/0800d2c24fbdf4c46d5c6ec6d397e8b1.poster.avif?t=1755482691\" width=1000 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994860/extras/0800d2c24fbdf4c46d5c6ec6d397e8b1.webm?t=1755482691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994860/extras/0800d2c24fbdf4c46d5c6ec6d397e8b1.mp4?t=1755482691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of space dishes, each has a place to use. Different star zones and different alien species all come along with their different tastes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restaurant management is full of variables and novelties! Whether it's a kitchen on fire or an uninvited quantum thief, there are always challenges waiting for you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique alien customers, from the cosmic gluttony who'll consume you if unsatisfied, to the pixel beings capable of teleporting into computers... The universe is never monotonous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994860/extras/10f47e116a6f836a50084ab7098f7d80.avif?t=1755482691\" width=1000 height=120 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore planets and search for rare ingredients</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numbers of unique planets await exploration, Hunting, gathering, solving puzzles and building. In randomly generated sandbox environments, no two expedition will ever be identical.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 unique guns! Who says chefs can't fight\uff1f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994860/extras/f17101ca3527d1236a1b810c991bca11.poster.avif?t=1755482691\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994860/extras/f17101ca3527d1236a1b810c991bca11.webm?t=1755482691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994860/extras/f17101ca3527d1236a1b810c991bca11.mp4?t=1755482691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go collect ingredients and satisfy your greed, but make sure to evacuate in time before oxygen runs out or you get eaten by aliens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprises await discovery for you during each adventure, whether it is a bottomless man-made abyss or a spacetime rift leading to another world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect genetic data on alien animals and plants, and you can raise alien plants and animals on your spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994860/extras/a23cfffde0d9e2840c7b38ce7d8dfb0e.avif?t=1755482691\" width=1000 height=120 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Foodies' Home</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a market to attract more food merchants. If you are tired to hunt, a good purchase at the market before starting &quot;food cruise&quot; will be a good choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in the entertainment squares here, from alien antiquities exhibition halls to Spa shops. Sometimes being a charterer is also a good choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994860/extras/ab074b71cf0c46dd86171c0ac1412604.poster.avif?t=1755482691\" width=850 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994860/extras/ab074b71cf0c46dd86171c0ac1412604.webm?t=1755482691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994860/extras/ab074b71cf0c46dd86171c0ac1412604.mp4?t=1755482691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More and more Space Foodies of different personalities and professions will gather with the prosperity of Foodie's Home. Some will become your employee companions, and some will provide professional support.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2994860?t=1755482691","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2994860?t=1755482691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994860/83a1f9d3cf1272de3d696e04b150bffe133f20de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755482691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994860/83a1f9d3cf1272de3d696e04b150bffe133f20de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755482691","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3930810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wherever intelligent life exists, conflicts, violence, and wars persist without end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet there are always those who care solely about one thing-discovering &quot;delicious food&quot; and sharing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These individuals are nicknamed &quot;Space Foodie&quot; across the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear Foodie, are you ready to begin your gourmet journey in the universe? Fire up your restaurant spaceship and set off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994860/extras/786737dcd39809f9ede4e6a08acd39c7.avif?t=1755482691\" width=1000 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run your restaurant spaceship</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From small to large spaceship, hundreds of decorations can be used to create your restaurant spaceship, both indoor and outdoor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking, serving, cleaning, you may be in a hurry. But don't worry, after you go t